@host = http://localhost:5080

### Login (seeded admin) — copy accessToken into @token below
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@company.com", "password": "Admin@123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.refreshToken}}

### Register a new user (always becomes Developer)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "new.dev@company.com", "password": "Sup3rSecret!", "firstName": "New", "lastName": "Dev" }

### Refresh token pair
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accessToken": "{{token}}", "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### Change password
POST {{host}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "Admin@123", "newPassword": "Admin@1234" }

### List users (users:view — Admin/Manager)
GET {{host}}/api/users?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List projects
# @name projects
GET {{host}}/api/projects?status=Active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@projectId = {{projects.response.body.items[0].id}}

### Create project (projects:create)
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "New Initiative", "description": "Something worth doing" }

### Project statistics
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create task
# @name task
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Wire up CI pipeline",
  "description": "GitHub Actions build + test + docker",
  "projectId": "{{projectId}}",
  "priority": "High",
  "estimatedHours": 6
}

###
@taskId = {{task.response.body.id}}

### List / filter tasks
GET {{host}}/api/tasks?status=InProgress&priority=High&sort=-dueDate&pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Overdue tasks
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Global task statistics
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Move task status (ToDo -> InProgress). Skipping states returns 409.
PATCH {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "InProgress" }

### Assign task (tasks:assign — Admin/Manager). null unassigns.
PATCH {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assigneeId": null }

### Change priority
PATCH {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/priority
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "priority": "Critical" }

### Add comment
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Started on this today." }

### List comments
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Soft-delete task (tasks:delete — Admin/Manager)
DELETE {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
